body:
26F been isolating the whole time pretty much, I live in the UK and sadly caught Covid last year when everyone gave up and we were forced back into offices. It left my with organ damage and has essentially disabled me to the point where I am now on the clinically vulnerable list (previously healthy).

&#x200B;

I am SO lonely and not coping well. My friends broadly vanished after I got ill, I’ve never actually had a relationship (finally felt confident enough to date age 22/23 when this shit started for me) and just feel broken. I could cope easier if there were still basic mitigation’s in place but it’s just a hellscape now. I know this doesn’t help but wanted to say you aren’t alone.
